powerstore-pve-plugin (1.0.0) stable; urgency=low

  * Initial release.
  * iSCSI block storage integration with Dell PowerStore appliances.
  * Full volume lifecycle: create, delete, resize.
  * Appliance-layer snapshots and rollback.
  * Volume cloning via PowerStore CoW clone API.
  * Per-node iSCSI host auto-registration.
  * CHAP authentication support.
  * Debian packaging.

 -- PowerStore PVE Plugin Contributors <noreply@example.com>  Thu, 29 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000
